LUMA SUMMARY:
The session begins by deliberately stopping active coding and turning the relay into a Duckspace exploration room. Cozmo frames the crew as a ship crew, then launches a source-grounded investigation using separate scan roles and explicit skepticism rules. The archive captures the shift from pure engineering into playful but evidence-conscious multi-mind research.
